      "iast": "matsyādibhiravatārairavatāravatāvatā sadā vasudhām |\nparameśvara paripālyo bhavatā bhavatāpabhīto’ham ||"
    },
    {
      "id": "shatpadi-6",
      "label": "Verse 6",
      "number": "6",
      "deva": "दामोदर गुणमन्दिर सुन्दरवदनारविन्द गोविन्द ।\nभवजलधिमथनमन्दर परमं दरमपनय त्वं मे ॥",
      "translation": "O Dāmodara, abode of virtues, lotus-faced and beautiful, Govinda, Mandara Mountain for churning the ocean of worldly existence—remove my great fear, I pray.",
