    },
    {
      "id": "shatpadi-7",
      "label": "Verse 7",
      "number": "7",
      "deva": "नारायण करुणामय शरणं करवाणि तावकौ चरणौ ।\nइति षट्पदी मदीये वदनसरोजे सदा वसतु ॥",
      "translation": "O Nārāyaṇa, full of compassion, I make your two feet my refuge. May this Ṣaṭpadī always dwell in the lotus of my mouth.",
